window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>She was the puppet. He pulled the strings. </p> <p>Now the death toll is rising - what could this mean? </p> <p>It was all a game…of feelings…of pain. </p> <p>Death is just an illusion, or so they say. </p> <p>She was just a pawn on a piece of his demented board. But there's only one question left to settle the score: Can dead people really stay dead?</p>"; 
